WEBVTT

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:21.800
Pictures: paste them, drop them, or Insert > Image. Click one to select it, drag a corner to resize.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:47.210
Two pictures side by side: right-click one and choose "Put side by side". Drag the bar between them to change the split.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:01:07.770
Shapes: 179 of them - flowchart, arrows, callouts, IT, diagram, marks. Pick one, then drag where it should go.

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:19.490
Type to write inside it. The shape bar sets outline, fill, line weight and text size.

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:25.770
A shape belongs to a paragraph: it moves, copies and prints with it - and the words always make room.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:34.367
Icons too: about 1,850 line icons from the toolbar, in any colour and size.

